  M_Pl -> 1.4 PeV (LHAASO photon): worst-case relative-speed suppression sigma_max = 0.923; next 0.882; best 0.286
     slowest initial pattern: B:-0.26, W:-0.01, G:+0.58, Q:+0.25, u:+0.17, d:+0.26, L:-0.18, e:-0.61, H:-0.21
     kick c_e=1: (c_e - c_B) -> 0.746, (c_e - mean) -> 0.831 of initial;  kick c_Q=1: (c_Q - c_G) -> 0.378
  M_Pl -> 1 TeV: worst-case relative-speed suppression sigma_max = 0.911; next 0.851; best 0.152
