== (b) power-law exponents z (delta ~ (mu/Lambda)^z) and suppression over D decades ==
  GNY chiral Ising, 4-eps, eps=1, N_f=1 (one-loop, derived)                z = 0.4667: factor over 16.1 decades = 3.11e-08
  GNY chiral Ising, 4-eps, eps=1, N_f=2 (graphene-like)                    z = 0.6190: factor over 16.1 decades = 1.10e-10
